  "title": "Brooke's Best Bombshell Brownies",
  "description": "This brownie recipe uses cocoa powder, semi-sweet chocolate morsels, and butter, of course, to make an incredibly rich, fudgy, chocolaty treat!",
  "authors": [
    "BROOKE"
  ],
